# STM32CubeIDE build output
Debug/
Release/

# Compiled objects and dependency files
*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.su
*.cyclo

# Firmware/build artifacts
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.list

# Eclipse workspace metadata
.metadata/

